            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagFuzzyThreshold=0.92
graphRagGroup=business
graphRagReviewBand=0.75
graphRagExtractionHints=Capabilities are printed as numbered sub-headings 'EE01 -- Determine Member Eligibility' with 'As Is' / 'To Be' maturity levels, as rows of a 'Business Capability Matrix', as the service described next to each legacy system ('SADLS\: Issues Driver License Credentials'), or as 'processus métier' / 'fonctions' in French documents. Extract one entity per process, not per paragraph.
graphRagMatch=fuzzy
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
          </ATTRIBUTES>
